{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271030","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1027103001:0":{"text":"딘 아저씨, 밭에 빈 땅도 많은데 시험삼아 작물을 심는 건 어때요?","source_cn":"迪恩叔叔，我看园子里还有不少空地，要不要试验性地种点作物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x214C67D654250AED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027103002:0":{"text":"반딧불이 열매나 점프콩이 좋겠어요! 반딧불이 열매는 시럽을 짤 수 있고 점프콩은 볶아서 먹거나 새총을 만들 수 있어요...","source_cn":"萤瓤果和跳跳豆就很不错！萤瓤果可以榨糖，跳跳豆不但可以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39C8F40BF85A364B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027103003:1":{"text":"...이는 좀 썩겠지만요!","source_cn":"……就是有点废牙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x565EE72DC8380721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027103004:0":{"text":"네 이 녀석, 또 무슨 짓을 벌이려고? 설마 저 열매들을 새로운 발명에 쓰려는 건 아니겠지?","source_cn":"你这孩子，又在出什么坏点子？不会有新发明要用到那些果子吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68B945B84BCB4313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027103005:0":{"text":"꼭 그런 건 아니지만, 쓰려면 확실히 아~주 많이 써야 하긴 해요!","source_cn":"也对，也不对。确实要用，而且用量很大——超级大！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9DBD8D851E60127","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027103006:0":{"text":"달빛호수 마을엔 딘 아저씨만한 재배 전문가는 또 없으니, 이렇게 부탁드릴게요!","source_cn":"整座月湖村里除了迪恩叔叔你，没人更了解种植，我只能来求你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FFBD1238F31B7EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027103007:0":{"text":"부탁드려요, 딘 아저씨!","source_cn":"拜托你了，迪恩叔叔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x614B80B7F28868CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027103008:0":{"text":"...생떼 부리지마. 절대 안 돼.","source_cn":"……别撒娇啊，这件事我真的不能答应你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB79A6900A341F864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027103009:1":{"text":"열매가 필요하다면 같이 따러갈 사람을 찾아봐.","source_cn":"要是想要果子，可以找人一起陪你去采摘嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E386A13867ED5D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1027103010:1":{"text":"매일 여기서 어슬렁거리지 말고 얼른 가서 또래 애들이랑 같이 놀거나!","source_cn":"别天天在我这逛，多和你同龄的孩子一起玩玩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x425576D7F382662F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027103011:0":{"text":"걔들은 도와주지도 않을 거예요! 인사해도 못 들은 척하고, 같이 놀아주지도 않고...","source_cn":"他们才不会帮我呢！和他们打招呼，他们都当没听见，出去玩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65537ECA090E5E43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1027103012:0":{"text":"대체 왜 그럴까요? 저는 목조 결구 방식이나 나사못의 메커니즘은 이해해도, 걔들 생각은 도통 알 수가 없다니까요!","source_cn":"究竟是为什么呢，我能想明白榫卯和螺钉的机理，也搞不懂他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66BD56C217737D89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1027103012":{"text":"대체 왜 그럴까요? 저는 목조 결구 방식이나 나사못의 메커니즘은 이해해도, 걔들 생각은 도통 알 수가 없다니까요!","source_cn":"究竟是为什么呢，我能想明白榫卯和螺钉的机理，也搞不懂他们的想法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66BD56C217737D89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1027103013:0":{"text":"괴롭히냐고요? 그렇게 나쁜 애들은 아니에요. 그냥 저랑 같이 안 놀뿐이죠!","source_cn":"针对？唔，大家没那么坏啦，我只是和他们玩不到一起！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF8067D48891EA6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1027103014:0":{"text":"참, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 좀 도와주실래요? 그냥 열매만 따다주시면 돼요!","source_cn":"对了，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC3A0D092815EA606","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"참, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 좀 도와주실래요? 그냥